<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday Excel Communications Inc, Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA, Russ Berrie and Co Inc, Texfi Industries Inc and Stone Energy Corp were unavailable due to news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA also is unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
